# Weekly execution plans, daily briefs/keys & reading summaries.
# Depth-independent on purpose: the month_NN/ archive folders must inherit the same
# exclusions, otherwise archiving a month silently publishes its sealed KEY files.
# This preserves the pre-archive status quo and does not settle P-47, which is the
# open question of what SHOULD be public.
**/planning/
**/daily/
**/ddia_summaries/
**/design/
docs/roadmap/
design/

# Local chat handoffs
*CHAT_HANDOFF*

# Scratch files & test payloads
large*.json
*.jpg
*.png
*.jpeg

# DSA drill scratch (coach compiles probes here, then deletes)
.dsa_tmp/
*.exe
